# Build products
build/
build-*/
*.o
*.obj
*.mod
*.exe
*.dll
# ...but legacy/yl/libiomp5md.dll is a SOURCE file, not a build artefact: it ships
# in the vendor snapshot and legacy/source-manifest.json asserts its sha256. The
# generic *.dll pattern above was meant for build output and caught it by accident,
# leaving the manifest claiming a file the repository did not contain -- so a clean
# clone failed `source-manifest.json does not verify` and NO target could build.
# Found while building the M2/M3 acceptance matrices, 2026-09-09.
!legacy/yl/*.dll
*.so

